He's been coming over to my house for forever and a day, and I never thought to ask what his first name is.

52
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:10,620
Why'd our teacher have to take the attendance sheet with him?

53
00:04:12,860 --> 00:04:13,280
Huh.

54
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:16,460
No harm in outright asking, is there?

55
00:04:18,220 --> 00:04:18,700
Hey!

56
00:04:19,660 --> 00:04:22,540
So, uh, Miyamura, you don't have a first name, do you?

57
00:04:22,780 --> 00:04:22,980
Huh?

58
00:04:24,140 --> 00:04:27,620
No! Not happening! That's the absolute last way I should figure this out!

59
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,220
Let's go get changed for gym.

60
