I think it's a combined class.

62
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:36,740
Huh?

63
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:41,040
Somebody call him by his first name. Come on, boys!

64
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:44,000
Hori's been watching us get undressed!

65
00:04:44,580 --> 00:04:45,420
What's with her?

66
00:04:46,140 --> 00:04:48,360
For real? Why would you peep on them?

67
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,760
You frustrated or what?

68
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:50,600
Yeah.

69
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:51,800
Ah!

70
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:02,740
Damn it, Ol.

71
00:05:02,740 --> 00:05:06,100
If he were a little bit smarter, I'd know.

72
00:05:07,220 --> 00:05:08,320
Yeah? You heading home?

73
